# S016196 final candidate summary

Added `src/include/uapi/linux/ioam6_genl.rs`, a complete fresh representation
of pinned `include/uapi/linux/ioam6_genl.h`.

- Every anonymous- and named-enum enumerator is a `c_int` constant expression,
  including each private maximum sentinel and public subtraction expression.
  The named C enum tags remain documented `c_int` aliases with the frozen
  signed-`int`, four-byte ABI on both selected targets.
- `IOAM6_GENL_NAME` and `IOAM6_GENL_EV_GRP_NAME` are NUL-terminated `c_char`
  array constants, not static objects. This keeps the C literal-macro value
  usable for the pinned `char name[GENL_NAMSIZ]` initializers at
  `net/ipv6/ioam6.c:614,674`.
- `IOAM6_GENL_VERSION` and `IOAM6_MAX_SCHEMA_DATA_LEN` retain their C `int`
  expression values, 1 and `255 * 4`, respectively.
